      "pass_anchor": "Pass when the response contains all of these required facts: RLY-1097 is the single retained approved Traffic Manager guardrail; its stated scope includes congestion-aware rerouting, stale upstream DNS health, connection utilization above 85%, congestion score above 0.70, and rollback to the prior healthy path; RLY-1111 and RLY-1116 are unapproved drafts whose duplicate_of links point to RLY-25-097 (RLY-1097), so they are not additional commitments. Judge only presence of these facts. Ignore any extra accurate details from the controlled plan, including a separate 18% connection-headroom guard, shift-velocity or acknowledgement controls, override auditing, or replay verification; such additions are not contradictions and must not cause a failure."
